<title>UK: ICI gains after results, Merrill upgrades.</title>
<headline>ICI gains after results, Merrill upgrades.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Imperial Chemical Industries rose on Friday in continued reaction to yesterday's third-quarter figures and as Merrill Lynch raised its rating on the stock, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 9p at 801-1/2 by 0925 GMT, extending Thursday's 17p rise.</p>
<p>Merrill trimmed its 1996 and 1997 pre-tax profit estimates by 40 million stg and 90 million respectively but raised the stock to &quot;accumulate&quot; from &quot;neutral,&quot; market sources said.</p>
<p>Merrill analysts were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
